### Node.js Backend — New Endpoint

#### [MODIFY] [chatController.js](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Downloads/FueChat-bot-backend/FueChat-bot-backend/fuebot-backend/controllers/chatController.js)

Add a new endpoint:

```
POST /chat/program-finder
Body: { answers: string[] }
```

- Takes the 7 quiz answers
- Constructs a detailed AI prompt with the student's answers
- Calls the Python AI `/api/v1/chat` endpoint with a specialized system instruction
- Streams the AI response back via SSE (same pattern as `sendMessage`)

#### [MODIFY] [chatRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Downloads/FueChat-bot-backend/FueChat-bot-backend/fuebot-backend/routes/chatRoutes.js)

