### Python AI Backend — New Prompt

#### [MODIFY] [main.py](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Downloads/FueChat-bot-backend/FueChat-bot-backend/main.py)

No changes needed — the existing `/api/v1/chat` endpoint will be reused. The Node.js backend will inject a special system-level message into the chat request that instructs the AI to act as a program recommender.

The AI prompt will be constructed in `chatController.js` like:

> "Based on the following answers from a freshman student, recommend the BEST program for them from: Computer Science, AI, Cybersecurity, Information Systems, or Data Science. Provide a detailed explanation of why this program fits them, list 3-4 key courses they'll take, and describe career opportunities."

