## Architecture Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Frontend (React)
    participant N as Node.js Backend
    participant P as Python AI Backend
    participant L as FreeModel LLM

    F->>N: POST /api/chat/program-finder {answers}
    N->>N: Construct AI prompt with answers
    N->>P: POST /api/v1/chat {message, session_id}
    P->>L: Chat completion (Claude Opus)
    L-->>P: Streaming response
    P-->>N: SSE stream
    N-->>F: SSE stream
    F->>F: Render recommendation with ReactMarkdown
```

